/**
 * How Crane in a circle (`tsuru-no-maru`) is constructed, in a line in each language: the text a crest's card shows beside its steps.
 * It is here, not on the crest's record, so that the manifest stays small; `crestConstruction()` loads it.
 *
 * @example
 * ```ts no-run
 * import { description } from "@johnmorrisdotca/kamon-crests/steps/tsuru-no-maru";
 *
 * console.log(description.en.length > 30, description.ja.endsWith("。")); // true true
 * ```
 */
const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"A crane seen from the front, its wings raised until their tips meet over its head: the long feathers make the crest's own circle and leave a round window. In the window the head is a circle with a ringed eye, the beak is two arcs that meet in a point with a white line between them, and the neck is the band between two circles about one point, bending down into the body. Each wing has thirteen white lines between its long feathers, every one an arc of the same compass width, 96, from the rim in to the small feathers. The small feathers are two rows of round ends about the body's centre, with a white line round each row. The body is a circle and the belly a smaller one below it, with a white line round the breast and four rows of scales under it. The right wing is built in full, then the head and the body, and the left wing where it stands.","ja":"正面から見た鶴です。翼を上げ、先が頭の上で出会うので、長い羽がそのまま紋の丸になり、中に丸い窓が残ります。窓の中の頭は円で、目は輪と点です。くちばしは、先で出会う二本の弧で、間に白い線が一本あります。首は、同じ中心の二つの円の間の帯で、曲がって体につながります。翼の長い羽の間には、白い線が十三本あります。どれも同じコンパスの幅96の弧で、外の円から小さい羽まで引きます。小さい羽は、体の中心のまわりに二列ならぶ丸い先で、列ごとに白い線で囲みます。体は円、腹はその下の小さい円です。胸のまわりに白い線があり、その下にうろこが四列ならびます。右の翼を作図してから、頭と体を作図し、左の翼はその場で作図します。"};

export default construction;
export { construction, description };
